```
id: SPL-003
name: Member added to local Administrators group
description: A user or group is added to the built-in Administrators group (4732).
platform: Splunk
mitre_tactic: Persistence
mitre_technique: T1098 Account Manipulation
severity: High
data_source: index=wineventlog (Security)
false_positives: IT onboarding and approved break-fix; endpoint management tools that add helpdesk
   groups.
tuning: Exclude approved management accounts; focus on servers and workstations outside the
   imaging process.
test_method: Add a lab user to the local Administrators group on a test host.
owner: <OWNER>
status: Draft
last_review: 2026-11-19
```
index=wineventlog sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4732 earliest=-1h
| search Group_Name="Administrators" OR Group_Domain="Builtin"
| eval actor=coalesce(src_user, Subject_Account_Name)
| table _time host actor Member_Security_ID Group_Name
| sort - _time
